<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">GOOD FOOD · GOOD DAYS</view><view class="row between"><view class="pill">{{space}}</view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="muted">处理中…</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="warning error">{{error}}</view><view class="title">留住想吃的味道</view><view class="subtitle">链接、字幕、图片，都可以成为菜谱的起点。</view><view class="warning">分享链接不等于视频文件。当前支持保存来源与手动整理；AI 文字整理需要后端配置，新增 Groq 语音转写试验入口，需要用户自己的 Groq 密钥。</view><view class="card"><view class="heading">粘贴分享文案或菜谱文字</view><textarea placeholder="粘贴抖音分享文案、视频字幕或文字菜谱" value="{{inputText}}" data-field="inputText" bindinput="field"/><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="importText">建立可编辑草稿</button><button bindtap="aiImport">AI 整理文字</button></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">本地视频</view><view class="note">先将视频留在设备中；当前不会自动上传，也未进行 AI 视频识别。</view><button bindtap="chooseVideo">选择视频并本地保存</button><video wx:if="{{video}}" src="{{video.path}}" style="width:100%" controls/></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">我的 AI 服务</view><view class="note">{{aiLabel}}</view><button id="ai-settings-entry" bindtap="aiSettings">设置服务、模型与 API Key</button></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">先把视频口播变成文字</view><view class="note">通过 Groq 转写短音频或 MP4，再带回本页整理为菜谱。</view><button id="groq-entry" bindtap="transcribe">Groq 语音转写（试验）</button></view></view>